            {
                "entry_id": "6286fc13-9f8d-3879-81a2-49b8a978961a",
                "word": "Tarzan",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b8e0e4bd-539d-4515-944b-d8f98bc793aa",
                        "entry_id": "6286fc13-9f8d-3879-81a2-49b8a978961a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Tarzans"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c906a7a-ae53-3667-9da0-b47cae5ad5fb",
                        "entry_id": "6286fc13-9f8d-3879-81a2-49b8a978961a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A strong wild man; any man showing attributes of Tarzan, as muscularity, agility, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2a0fd28-b80d-4ee4-a6af-9b349d1afa5e",
                                "sense_id": "5c906a7a-ae53-3667-9da0-b47cae5ad5fb",
                                "text": "PAYNE STEWART, beating his heart like a Tarzan, drummed out a message to the rest of the Open Championship field with three days to go before the off. \"I'm ready,\" he said, \"definitely ready.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66b1aabe-9159-4489-8157-539bfc307e52",
                                "sense_id": "5c906a7a-ae53-3667-9da0-b47cae5ad5fb",
                                "text": "\"[A]s if we all like climbing around in trees, like monkeys or Tarzans.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72037914-cb98-48b2-a235-ade951e23c5a",
                                "sense_id": "5c906a7a-ae53-3667-9da0-b47cae5ad5fb",
                                "text": "The top price of £4,500 belongs to Michael Heseltine, but there is little glory here. The caption, of a Tarzan cruelly ravaged by time, is 'But even the beautiful can age.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91017d7f-9835-4a6f-ad8e-b444f6968680",
                                "sense_id": "5c906a7a-ae53-3667-9da0-b47cae5ad5fb",
                                "text": "There was nothing really statuesque about him; this wasn't a kind of Tarzan, with massive shoulders and great muscles and limbs as strong as a beast's, but a tall, lean, handsome man, who moved with superlative ease."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "7dad6e8e-a409-3364-8651-a6295dfe991e",
