                        ],
                        "form": "Tarzaned"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ca7d952e-9593-4075-befc-d105207d7261",
                        "entry_id": "7dad6e8e-a409-3364-8651-a6295dfe991e",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "Tarzaned"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                        "entry_id": "7dad6e8e-a409-3364-8651-a6295dfe991e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To behave in the manner of Tarzan, especially by swinging from ropes, climbing trees, and other feats of athleticism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6811b80-345b-440d-9bd7-a6adccfd4ab0",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "Elmo Lincoln, that mighty man of valor who Tarzaned about, has issued a challenge to Jack Dempsey, and we wish him all the luck in the world."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b9c7c31-d0f3-40b6-ae68-6b522a01123b",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "Later in the evening a tree climbing contest was held. Paul Gipe was the only entry. However, judging from the manner in which he tarzaned up and down the big tree he would have had small competition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8671c08f-fd28-4dfd-a12a-cecdb250e38d",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "Once, when he was about 12, he had attached a rope to the roof, thrown the other end to the top of a tree and the next morning \"Tarzaned\" across from the tree to his parents' window. He could still remember the look of startled anger on their faces, and how it changed to the one of pleasure they always had for him. After that he often \"Tarzaned\" in for a morning visit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47880427-2d56-4be3-9c59-e2d85b5ee25f",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "None of us had ever \"Tarzaned\" off a cliff[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2b20b1b-0aac-4c6b-b627-ca0aa9f4addc",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "\"He Tarzaned it,\" Abshier says, describing Deputy King's wild, but ultimately successful, flying tackle. \"He spent the rest of the day pulling dewberry stickers out of his pants.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a84c581a-b7ed-4f88-a786-521e9a81debe",
                                "sense_id": "5192f340-29b9-319d-9ddc-d819641285a2",
                                "text": "Being a devotee of the Johnny Weismuller school of Tarzaning, no wasp-waisted cartoon character can get my blood aboil."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
